<title>USA: Ely ISD 696, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Ely ISD 696, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co. Inc. said it won $1.015 million of Ely ISD 696, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.4047 percent.</p>
